					While holding SHPC, right click switches to Karasawa charge-cannon mode
					Hold right click to charge, then release a defense-piercing hypervelocity energy cannon; releasing too early triggers a failure cooldown
					KARASAWA cannon... what an excellent weapon...
					Unfortunately, it has gathered dust in storage for far too long
					No matter what, it must see the light of day again
					''' */
			}

